        "bbox": [
          514.0,
          554.0,
          933.0,
          879.0
        ],
        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "For example, for the series Rg(Th-5,4/p) the degree of polymerization of the CHCl<sub>3</sub> fraction increased from $x = 3 9$to 52 to 69 for the butyl, octyl, and dodecyl homologues $( p = 4 ,$8, 12), respectively."
      },
      "confidence": {
        "score": 0.9
      }
    },
    {
      "sample_id": "s004",
      "sample_kind": "synthesis_batch",
      "refers_to_entity": "pe004",
      "polymer_name": "Rg(Th-5,4/1)",
      "sample_label_raw": "Rg(Th-5,4/1)",
      "state_description": "with a short alkyl side chain, i.e., methyl",
      "intended_use": [],
      "evidence": {
        "block_id": "P_2_38",
        "page": 2,
        "bbox": [
          514.0,
          404.0,
          933.0,
          555.0
        ],
        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "Notably, attempts to prepare Rg(Th-5,4/1) (with a short alkyl side chain, i.e., methyl) and Rg(Th-5,8/8) and Rg(Th-5,8/12) (with long heptadecafluorooctyl segments, i.e., $m = 8 )$were hindered by the insolubility of the resulting polymers."
      },
      "confidence": {
        "score": 0.8
